,"artwork":"images/artists/twista/tracks/lavish-feat-pharrell-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Mw4mBRRhFsc","slug":"414","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-414/ra.1470719147","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-414"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #414","artwork":"images/episodes/414.png","content":"\nMusic from Daniel Caesar and Freddie Gibbs & Madlib\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2019-06-29T10:06:55+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"mUYdk0CgSGg","position":20,"timestamp":"00:41:01","rawTrack":"Twista - When I Get You Home (A.I.O.U.) [feat. Jamie Foxx & Pharrell]","track":{"id":"Qc7VQGJHW4o","path":"/artists/twista/tracks/when-i-get-you-home-a-i-o-u-feat-jamie-foxx-pharrell/","slug":"when-i-get-you-home-aiou-feat-jamie-foxx-and-pharrell","title":"When I Get You Home (A.I.O.U.) [feat. Jamie Foxx & Pharrell]","artist":{"slug":"twista","title":"Twista"},"artwork":"images/artists/twista/tracks/when-i-get-you-home-a-i-o-u-feat-jamie-foxx-pharrell.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Mw4mBRRhFsc","slug":"414","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-414/ra.1470719147","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-414"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #414","artwork":"images/episodes/414.png","content":"\nMusic from Daniel Caesar and Freddie Gibbs & Madlib\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2019-06-29T10:06:55+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"cho3gb6mid8","position":12,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Twista - Overnight Celebrity (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"B-jkeUKyXD4","path":"/artists/twista/tracks/overnight-celebrity-instrumental/","slug":"overnight-celebrity-instrumental","title":"Overnight Celebrity (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"twista","title":"Twista"},"artwork":"images/artists/twista/tracks/overnight-celebrity-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PQcEHD74TwM","slug":"141","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-141-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #141 w/ Colta (Team Supreme)","artwork":"/images/episodes/141.jpg","content":"\nColta from Team Supreme drops a set to promote the (Team Supreme x Soulection Takeover @ The Echo)\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10821,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"9aNrrqz0aj8","position":70,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Twista - Overnight Celebrity (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"B-jkeUKyXD4","path":"/artists/twista/tracks/overnight-celebrity-instrumental/","slug":"overnight-celebrity-instrumental","title":"Overnight Celebrity (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"twista","title":"Twista"},"artwork":"images/artists/twista/tracks/overnight-celebrity-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"UMjXwUAv27s","slug":"148","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-148"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #148","artwork":"/images/episodes/148.jpg","content":"\nContinuing Joe Kay's 24th birthday celibration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nIn celebration of Joe's 24th birthday yesterday, we started celebrating on Thursday at The Sound of Tomorrow (The Crosby) with Astronautica & starRo! Thank you to everyone who came out and supported, what a show it was. This radio session is just a continuation of the celebration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard. \nBless to those who tuned into the live broadcast via Kbeach. It's amazing to think about how far we've came. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10830,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"n0lz9Ga26Ng","position":45,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Twista - Overnight Celebrity (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"B-jkeUKyXD4","path":"/artists/twista/tracks/overnight-celebrity-instrumental/","slug":"overnight-celebrity-instrumental","title":"Overnight Celebrity (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"twista","title":"Twista"},"artwork":"images/artists/twista/tracks/overnight-celebrity-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xj9ohERACh8","slug":"153","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-153-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #153 w/ Dream Koala","artwork":"/images/episodes/153.jpg","content":"\nJoe Kay kicked things off with heavy, heavy vibes from many brand new/unheard artists and collectives. \n<!--more-->\n\nThe selection in here was really well thought out and analyzed properly so take notes.\n\nShouts to Geode and the Chord Marauders who sent over their forthcoming compilation which is simply amazing. Pay attention to these guys, trust. Also look out for Sunni Colòn & Jarreau Vandal. These two artists will be breakthrough artists on Soulection in 2014; guaranteed. We had special guest Dream Koala stop by who is visiting LA for his 1st time all the way from Berlin (current residence but originally from Paris). The young 19 year old threw down a DJ set that included bass and uptempo tribal vibes. In fact, his set was very different from his original production. Dream Koala is very talented and we look forward to see and hear what's to come. \n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10840,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-23T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"2TqYyMfoOIk","position":19,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Twista - Overnight Celebrity (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"B-jkeUKyXD4","path":"/artists/twista/tracks/overnight-celebrity-instrumental/","slug":"overnight-celebrity-instrumental","title":"Overnight Celebrity (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"twista","title":"Twista"},"artwork":"images/artists/twista/tracks/overnight-celebrity-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"BDetsr-_b9I","slug":"154","tags":[1,15],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #154","artwork":"/images/episodes/154.jpg","content":"Joe Kay really displayed a crazy selection of music that will have you copying/pasting consistently within Google for some time. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are a lot of new tunes sprinkled with the 'feel-good' classics that we always connect to our sets. It's essential for us to keep educating you with the influences and how it all connects to where we are today. Spread this set to as many people as possible! More minds and ears need to hear this music!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10901,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-30T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"DkatVvdzpR4","position":32,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Twista - So Sexy Ft R Kelly (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"m9kG_By3R-U","path":"/artists/twista/tracks/so-sexy-ft-r-kelly-instrumental/","slug":"so-sexy-ft-r-kelly-instrumental","title":"So Sexy Ft R Kelly (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"twista","title":"Twista"},"artwork":"images/artists/twista/tracks/so-sexy-ft-r-kelly-instrumental.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"KGbt4wCudfQ","slug":"168","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-168-sxsw"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #168 (SXSW Pre Show)","artwork":"/images/episodes/168.jpg","content":"Joe kay getting you ready for SXSW.\n<!--more-->\n\nAs we are getting ready for SXSW we wanted to get you in the spirit. Joe Kay went solo again to keep things simple and focused. He kicked it off with the new Carmack/Esta collab, played some new discoveries/unreleased gems, and then switched up the whole format by letting the live listener selects the music by sending us our requests via our social media networks. What a beautiful thing! For over 2 hours, you had the chance to selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"qVi9IRgvicc","position":59,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Twista - So Sexy (Joe kay’s Slowed Edit)","track":{"id":"W2SGsJxYETk","path":"/artists/twista/tracks/so-sexy-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit/","slug":"so-sexy-joe-kays-slowed-edit","title":"So Sexy (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","artist":{"slug":"twista","title":"Twista"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"jTSehXE5AIc","slug":"169","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-169"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #169","artwork":"/images/episodes/169.jpg","content":"Plenty of new music stacked ready to share with you.\n<!--more-->\n\nIt felt good to be back after being away from the studio for 4 weeks. We've been traveling for the past month spreading The Sound of Tomorrow at SXSW, WMC, and now Asia. The pros of being away for so long meant that Joe stacked up on plenty of music for the past month which makes up for the lost time, trust. There is too much to say and talk about but shout out to all of the amazing people who came out to our shows to see and connect with us. We are very grateful!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"-a7rBczyVfw","position":7,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Twista - Overnight Celebrity (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"B-jkeUKyXD4","path":"/artists/twista/tracks/overnight-celebrity-instrumental/","slug":"overnight-celebrity-instrumental","title":"Overnight Celebrity (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"twista","title":"Twista"},"artwork":"images/artists/twista/tracks/overnight-celebrity-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"M2wkPVc9GEQ","slug":"188","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-188-w-lakim"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #188 w/ LAKIM","artwork":"/images/episodes/188.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10620,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-10-11T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Interview w/ Lakim","position":2}},{"id":"QUb5bj0kEMc","position":69,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Twista - So Sexy (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","track":{"id":"W2SGsJxYETk","path":"/artists/twista/tracks/so-sexy-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit/","slug":"so-sexy-joe-kays-slowed-edit","title":"So Sexy (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","artist":{"slug":"twista","title":"Twista"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"H72dT7S3xco","slug":"205","tags":[7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-205-finale-from-cape-town-south-africa"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #205 (Finale From Cape Town, South Africa)","artwork":"/images/episodes/205.jpg","content":